NO GAME CONTENT
---------------
The APKs built from this repository contain no game content: no game models,
textures, sounds, music, videos, fonts, saves, quest or dialogue texts or other
resources of «Корсары: Каждому своё». The repository contains none of them
either, apart from the screenshots named below, and no links to download the
game. None of that is covered by the licence above. Players use their own legally obtained
copy of the game; the app copies it from a folder, archive or installer the
player chooses, or downloads it from a torrent file or magnet link the player
provides, on the player's own device.

The one exception: the three screenshots in docs/screenshots (interior.jpg,
sea.jpg, hero.jpg) show the game running in the app. The game's graphics in
them belong to the game's rights holders, are shown for illustration only and
are not covered by the licence of this repository.

Apart from those screenshots, the only game-related material here comes from
what the developers published under GPL-3.0 in storm-devs/sd-teho-public
(https://github.com/storm-devs/sd-teho-public): the game's scripts and its
interface texts.

  app/mobile-ui/PROGRAM/interface/mainmenu.c   adapted from that repository's
      program/interface/mainmenu.c (revision and changes: app/mobile-ui/SOURCE.json)
  app/script-patches/sets/**                   unified diffs against its scripts;
      each fix records its licence and source in set.json, and packaging
      refuses a fix under any licence other than GPL-3.0
  engine/src/libs/ui/tests/**, engine/tests/**  test data for the interface
      checks; some of it carries short interface labels (names of items, skills,
      buttons, one-line prompts, the hero's name) as that repository's scripts and
      resource/ini/texts spell them. The longer texts in the test data are invented for the tests.

